<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.alneb.Atlas</id>
  <name>Atlas</name>
  <summary>A workspace over plain files: notes, papers, mail, code and terminals</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>AGPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>Atlas is a fast desktop workspace over a folder of plain files. Notes render like Obsidian, with wikilinks,
      embeds, callouts, LaTeX and Bases tables; papers come with their PDFs and annotations; code gets language
      servers; terminals run beside your notes. Plugins in plain JavaScript add the rest.</p>
  </description>
